{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2008-common-biology-18","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2008,"subject":"biology","number":18,"points":null,"unitId":"gene","unitLabel":"분자생물학·유전자 발현","topic":"돌연변이·코돈","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["gene","biomol","ecology"],"stem":"진핵생물유전자의암호화부위(coding region) 뉴클레오티드서열은\n점돌연변이에의해아미노산이바뀌는치환지점(replacement sites)과\n아미노산이바뀌지않는침묵지점(silent sites)으로나뉜다. 진핵\n생물의치환지점과침묵지점에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>\n에서모두고른것은? (단, 점돌연변이는염기치환돌연변이만을\n의미한다.)\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 코돈에서세번째뉴클레오티드는모두침묵지점이다.\nㄴ. 유전자암호화부위에는치환지점의개수가침묵지점보다더\n많다.\nㄷ. 유전자의진화초기에는침묵지점의점돌연변이가치환지점의\n점돌연변이보다더빠르게축적된다.\nㄹ. 종(species) 간상동유전자(homologous genes) 암호화부위\n사이에서는침묵지점의뉴클레오티드서열유사도가\n치환지점의뉴클레오티드서열유사도보다더높다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":780,"height":407,"region":0,"bbox":[13.955,132.068,312.0,162.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-common-biology-18/01.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":9,"sourceRect":[429.645,152.732,758.256,498.835],"width":328.611,"height":346.103,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[13.955,132.068,312.0,162.8],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"18. 진핵생물유전자의암호화부위(coding region) 뉴클레오티드서열은","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.54,11.995],"spans":[{"text":"18.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,16.282,11.995],"origin":[5.0,14.596],"size":11.687,"flags":0,"font":"T1"},{"text":" 진","bbox":[21.282,5.768,17.4